'''weight<sup>2</sup>''' (wāt), ''n.'' See ''wecht''.

'''weightily''' (wā′ti-li), ''adv.'' In a weighty manner. {{smaller|(''a'') Heavily; ponderously. (''b'') With force or impressiveness; with moral power.}}

'''weightiness''' (wā′ti-nes), ''n.'' The state or quality of being weighty; ponderousness; heaviness, literally or figuratively; solidity; force; importance.

